UID:5JT5Mcv2vSTnOBlamgrCI
SUMMARY:Monthly SINGO Bingo 2026 - August
DTSTAMP:20260804T053524Z
DTSTART:20260821T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Turn the volume up and the worries down—SINGO Bingo is back\, a
	nd it’s here to play louder than ordinary bingo ever could. \nThis monthly
	 favorite blends the joy of music with the thrill of the game. Songs repla
	ce numbers\, laughter replaces silence\, and every round becomes a shared 
	rhythm of anticipation. Designed with accessibility at the center\, SINGO 
	Bingo features Braille and large-print cards so participants who are blind
	 or low vision can play fully\, confidently\, and independently. \nFree an
	d open to the community\, this is a night to unwind\, connect\, and let th
	e music carry you. No pressure. No experience required. Just good company\
	, great sound\, and a little luck along the way. \nSpots fill quickly—regi
	ster online and claim your seat at the table.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse
	.org/event/monthly-singo-bingo-2026-august/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-singo-bingo-2026-august/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
